            ^"Source Page" INTEGER 253
            ^"Description" STRING "Scheme actions allow a character to attempt to influence targets with whom they can communicate—manipulating them, wearing them down, or bringing them around to a different point of view. A Scheme action usually specifies at least one target who suffers any relevant effects."
            ^"Requirement" STRING "To affect another character with a Scheme action, a character must generally be able to communicate with that character, verbally or otherwise."
